{"id":"1a16bf3c-0dc2-4006-8620-2eec5b355e07","object":"chat.completion","created":1795243540,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT p.product_category_name, COUNT(DISTINCT ri.refund_id) AS refund_order_cnt\nFROM refund_items ri\nJOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = ri.order_id AND oi.order_item_id = ri.order_item_id\nJOIN products p ON p.product_id = oi.product_id\nWHERE p.product_category_name IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY p.product_category_name\nORDER BY refund_order_cnt DESC, p.product_category_name ASC\nLIMIT 100;","reasoning_content":"We need answer SQL only. Need parse. Need use schema. Need stats: \"按实际退款明细对应商品的非NULL类目，统计每类目发生过的不同退款单数；同一退款单涉及多个类目时各类目分别计一次。\"\n\nWe need count distinct refunds per product category for actual refund items. Tables: refunds, refund_items, order_items, products. Need link refund_items to order_items. Join plan odd: products.product_id = order_items.product_id; products.category = translation; order_items.order_item_id = refund_items.order_item_id; refund_items.refund_id = refunds.refund_id. But refund_items has order_id and order_item_id, order_items pk (order_id, order_item_id). Need join on both order_id and order_item_id to avoid cross-order item id collisions. Use refund_items ri JOIN order_items oi ON oi.order_id = ri.order_id AND oi.order_item_id = ri.order_item_id. JOIN products p ON p.product_id=oi.product_id. JOIN refunds r ON r.refund_id=ri.refund_id maybe needed \"实际退款明细\" and \"发生过的不同退款单数\"; Need status? \"实际退款明细\" likely refund_items actual detail. \"非NULL类目\" means products.product_category_name IS NOT NULL. Count distinct refund_id. Do we need refunds table? To ensure \"实际退款\" maybe refunds status=4? User says \"实际退款明细对应商品\" not \"已退款状态\". Need be careful. The table refund_items itself represents refund line items, \"实际退款明细\" could just mean actual refund_items. \"不同退款单数\" count distinct r.refund_id. We may not need refunds unless to restrict valid refunds. But \"退款单\"